From 33846ac6e7ba10ff1fa1650fc5e8b9a67fb74409 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AzabAi <dev@alazab.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 20:51:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: harden legacy API and MCP endpoint for Frappe 16

- legacy writes (create/update/delete_doc) accept POST only; reads GET/POST
- persist audit rows of failed authenticated direct calls (rollback first, never for unauthenticated)
- throttle failed authentication on mcp_server.transport.handle (30/min/IP)
- cast pagination values (strings on GET)
- remove dead whitelist-registry code in mcp_tool
- add regression tests, CI validator workflow, production notes
- bump version to 1.0.1
